# Preserved failure while recording the safety-filter failure

The first tool call to store this incident was itself rejected by the JavaScript parser before apply_patch was called:

    Script error:
    SyntaxError: missing ) after argument list

The raw JavaScript template string contained unescaped Markdown backticks around execution.items, terminating that template. No patch was applied and no process or scientific program ran. The immediate retry removed those markup delimiters and stored the requested recorder, original traceback and this incident record. No scientific source or verifier change was involved.
